  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableNote
  title: Memo
  body: 'DRAFT (Abdelhamid: final text)


    The one they caught on the high street
    is the first live subject we have ever held.


    If H-7 holds, every station
    gets a supply. Transfer at dawn. If he wakes, seal the corridor and call the
    courtyard squad.'
