  title: Report H-7
  body: 'DRAFT (Abdelhamid: final text)


    Serum H-7 works. The subject in cell
    1 has stopped burning through blood: the hunger, the decay, the clock, all of
    it stops.


    Side effect: he is weak. No reserve, no tricks. He sleeps most
    of the day.


    Keep him sedated until the transfer. Do NOT feed him.'
